  },
  "question": {
    "text": "The coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is __________ ."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "960",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We need to find the coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup></math>.</p><p>We know that for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>!</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>!</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mi>c</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></math></p><p>Now for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>!</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>!</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>c</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>!</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>!</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></math>. with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>Here we need coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math>.</p><p>Hence the combinations would be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnlines=\"solid solid none\" rowlines=\"solid solid solid none\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>&nbsp;</p><p>which satisfies both&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>.</p><p>Hence, coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;will be,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>960</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}